    Bug 1958052 - Use a more traditional maildir file naming scheme, rather than "Message-Id.eml". r=heather


    Part of the process of decoupling nsIMsgPlugableStore from the database.
    Using Message-Id for the filename is problematic as we need the database to
    access it. Also, it's not very... maildir-y.
    This patch aims to use the more traditional scheme outlined in:
    https://cr.yp.to/proto/maildir.html

    But we still need to use a ".eml" file extension for OS search integration,
    which also isn't very maildir-y.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D244477

